{"id":"n91689-2-7","stage":3,"title":"화면 · 画面","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n91689-2-7-1","ko":"내 컴퓨터는 화면이 작아서 불편해.","zh":"我的电脑屏幕太小了，用起来很不方便。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내","meaning":"“나의(我的)”的缩略。","explanation":"내：“나의(我的)”的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84426","senseId":"1","lemma":"내","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"컴퓨터는","meaning":"电脑","explanation":"컴퓨터：电脑；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"컴퓨터","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72167","senseId":"1","lemma":"컴퓨터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"컴퓨터는","audio":"/audio/ba781be69a9f00d58b7d.mp3"}},{"text":"화면이","meaning":"屏幕","explanation":"화면：屏幕；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"화면","audio":"/audio/b5361f64b2ea31de8f50.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91689","senseId":"2","lemma":"화면","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화면이","audio":"/audio/e770296b2d2551fb252d.mp3"}},{"text":"작아서","meaning":"小， 矮","explanation":"작다：小， 矮；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"작다","audio":"/audio/bc42f85bf5be37c92f7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69513","senseId":"1","lemma":"작다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"작아서","audio":"/audio/634e7d57e83644bfb560.mp3"}},{"text":"불편해.","meaning":"不便，不方便","explanation":"불편하다：不便，不方便；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"불편하다","audio":"/audio/e3a81c369f5e123fbec0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71049","senseId":"1","lemma":"불편하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불편해","audio":"/audio/9ef066a18068e6be3d1c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b3378685b76ee79f","term":"내","zh":"“나의(我的)”的缩略。","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3","entryId":"84426","definition":"“나의(我的)”的缩略。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"cff8b0