IKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"컴퓨터로","audio":"/audio/7bc6c265972b19286917.mp3"}},{"text":"바꿔.","meaning":"换，更换，调换","explanation":"바꾸다：换，更换，调换；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"바꾸다","audio":"/audio/5cc3393b01c955d1c3fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17198","senseId":"1","lemma":"바꾸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바꿔","audio":"/audio/aaf9f253fd04921d1f86.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"大，高，长，壮阔","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"长度、宽度、高度、体积等都超出了普通程度。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"b5361f64b2ea31de","term":"화면","zh":"画面","audio":"/audio/b5361f64b2ea31de8f50.mp3","entryId":"91689","definition":"电影投射的屏幕或电视等出现的影像，或指该影像出现的面。","pronunciation":["화ː면"]},{"id":"cff8b01657dff709","term":"컴퓨터","zh":"电脑","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3","entryId":"72167","definition":"利用电路线快速、准确地处理文件、照片、影像等大量数据的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"5cc3393b01c955d1","term":"바꾸다","zh":"换，更换，调换","audio":"/audio/5cc3393b01c955d1c3fb.mp3","entryId":"17198","definition":"去掉原来的东西，用其他东西替代。","pronunciation":["바꾸다"]}],"audio":"/audio/411c79ae11609541da02.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.189,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=91689","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":113,"sequenceScore":2.9143,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那就换一台屏幕更大的电脑吧。","吐司好像有点油腻啊。","我的电脑屏幕太小了，用起来很不方便。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那就换一台屏幕更大的电脑吧。","我的电脑屏幕太小了，用起来很不方便。","吐司好像有点油腻啊。"],"answer":0}]}
